name: praxo-core
version: 0.2.1
date: 2026-11-05
author: AxisVela
maintainer: AxisVela <releases@axisvela.com>
title: PRAXO-CORE agent framework Core for GNU Octave
description: Native Octave Core for the PRAXO-CORE agent framework. It provides
 tools, policy hooks, events, memory, checkpoints, context compaction,
 middleware, JSON Schema validation, plugin manifest parsing, and a native
 agent loop without a Go or other language runtime.
categories: package
license: MIT
depends: octave (>= 7.0.0)
